<title>FRANCE: Saint-Gobain says Cise sale finalised.</title>
<headline>Saint-Gobain says Cise sale finalised.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French glassmaker Saint-Gobain said on Thursday that the sale of its Cise subsidiary to Bouygues and Bouygues' Saur unit closed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the terms had not changed from those announced in December, when Bouygues said it and Saur would pay 2.16 billion francs to acquire 80 percent of Cise to create the third largest French public contract management firm.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
